WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.485
The browser decides whether Telo Ride can reach the bike. Now Connect Bike says when

00:00:07.485 --> 00:00:08.836
it can't, and why.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.468
Connect Bike lists what it works with: four Echelon models with full control, and

00:00:15.468 --> 00:00:17.737
other FTMS smart bikes in beta.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:26.651
In Safari or Firefox, an alert replaces the device card and says to open Telo Ride

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:28.269
in Chrome or Edge.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:35.554
Try again reads the browser once more, and as soon as Bluetooth is there, the pair

00:00:35.554 --> 00:00:36.860
button comes back.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:47.663
The secure page is checked first. On plain http, Chrome hides Bluetooth too, and the

00:00:47.663 --> 00:00:51.223
fix is the HTTPS page, not another browser.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:58.420
So on a plain http page, the alert offers one link: the same address, over HTTPS.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:08.843
In production, the API sends every plain http request on to the same address over

00:01:08.843 --> 00:01:09.654
HTTPS.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:18.196
And every secure response tells the browser to use HTTPS for a year, so it never

00:01:18.196 --> 00:01:20.053
asks over http again.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.284
Class Start, Custom workout and Custom ride bring their own notices and disabled

00:01:27.284 --> 00:01:29.579
start buttons when they are built.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:38.085
Connect Bike shows the same list on a phone, a tablet, a laptop or a desktop.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:48.117
What the tests prove: seventeen behaviour specs and twenty-eight backend tests, all

00:01:48.117 --> 00:01:48.770
green.

00:01:53.561 --> 00:01:58.164
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:58.509 --> 00:02:03.021
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:02:03.021 --> 00:02:04.692
every hill and interval.

00:02:05.037 --> 00:02:10.215
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:02:10.215 --> 00:02:15.663
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:15.663 --> 00:02:18.653
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:18.998 --> 00:02:21.491
A custom workout lives under Profile.
